type: software
title: "peacock: Quick Project Initialization with Templates"
abstract: >-
  Initialize project directory structures from pre-configured templates.
  Scaffolds for Shiny applications, reproducible analyses, Quarto projects,
  Python projects, and tool comparisons are created with one function call.
